WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
JPM-CRED: Morning Diego, following up on the auto issuer basis level you were going to prepare.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Diego: Morning, I have it ready. We can do one hundred million two-way at the levels we discussed.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
JPM-CRED: Great, let me pass that to the client and confirm within the hour.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Diego: Sounds good, the level is good until midday our time, after that I would need to refresh it.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
JPM-CRED: Understood, we should have an answer well before then.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
JPM-CRED: Client confirms, they want to trade the full one hundred million at your level.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Diego: Confirming one hundred million on the auto issuer basis, executing now on our side.

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
JPM-CRED: Perfect, that closes out the interest they flagged yesterday.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Diego: Glad we could get it done cleanly, the levels held up well overnight.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
JPM-CRED: Appreciate you turning this around quickly, made the client's decision easy.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
Diego: Happy to help, let me know if there is more interest behind this one.

12
00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:00.000
JPM-CRED: Will do, I will send the trade confirmation shortly.

13
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Diego: Sounds good, thanks for the quick turnaround on your end too.
